  "decision_rule": "Reject the null hypothesis (i.e., establish a predictive relationship) if the correlation coefficient is statistically significant at p < 0.05 (after multiplicity adjustment if applicable) and the effect size is deemed practically meaningful (e.g., correlation coefficient > 0.3).",
